Silencio Peaq SDK - Native Module
==================================

This artifact (store.silencio:silenciopeaqsdk-native:2.1.3) is a 16KB
page-aligned repackage of upstream Nova Wallet substrate-sdk-android
version 2.1.3.

Upstream source:
  https://github.com/novasamatech/substrate-sdk-android

Original work:
  Copyright (c) Novasama Technologies / Nova Wallet
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Modifications by Silencio Network (2026):
  - Rebuilt the arm64-v8a libsr25519java.so from the novasamatech
    sr25519-java source with -Wl,-z,max-page-size=16384 to produce a
    16KB-aligned ELF, as required by Android 15+ on devices with 16KB
    memory pages (Google Play 2025 requirement).
  - All other classes, JVM resources, and remaining architecture .so
    files (armeabi-v7a, x86, x86_64) are preserved verbatim from the
    upstream 2.1.3 release.
  - Republished under store.silencio Maven coordinates; the POM
    declares the same transitive runtime dependencies as upstream.

No source code changes were made to upstream Java/Kotlin sources;
the only modification is the rebuilt arm64-v8a libsr25519java.so
described above.

